  "strict": "(there exists node x0, (for every node x1, (x1 equals x0))) and ((for every state x2, (for every node x3, (if (x2 active x3), then (there exists data_entry x4, (there exists node_data x5, (there exists node x6, (there exists identifier x7, ((x4 entry_state x2) and ((x4 entry_node x3) and ((x4 entry_value x5) and ((x5 successor x6) and ((x3 node_id x7) and ((for every node x8, (if ((x2 active x8) and (not (x8 equals x3))), then (there exists identifier x9, (there exists identifier x10, ((x8 node_id x9) and ((x6 node_id x10) and (not (tc[identifier x11, x12 | ((x11 next_id x12) and (not (x12 equals x7)))](x9, x10))))))))) and ((not (x6 equals x3)) or (there exists node x13, ((x2 active x13) and (for every node x14, (if (x2 active x14), then (x14 equals x13))))))))))))))))))) and (for every node x15, (there exists state x16, (x16 active x15)))).\n",
